   String(localized:locale:) does not select .lproj (see LocalizedStrings). */

/* Operation names [UD-06]. The Undo menu wraps these as "Undo %@", so in English
   they read as a bare verb phrase ("Move …"), while Japanese uses a noun phrase.
   These also become the operation-history summary [OH-02], but filtering there is
   keyed on the type name, so translating them doesn't break search. */
